---
import SectionHeading from "./SectionHeading.astro";
---

<section class="stories">

  <div class="container">

    <SectionHeading
      eyebrow="VIRTUOSA STORIES"
      title="Lives Transformed. Faith Strengthened."
      text="Every Virtuosa has a story. Discover how God is working through our community to transform lives, build faith and inspire purpose."
    />

    <div class="stories-grid">

      <article class="story-card">

        <div class="quote-mark">“</div>

        <p>

          Joining Christian Women Community has deepened my relationship
          with God and connected me with incredible women who continually
          encourage my faith journey.

        </p>

        <div class="story-author">

          <div class="avatar">

            EO

          </div>

          <div>

            <h4>Esther O.</h4>

            <span>United Kingdom</span>

          </div>

        </div>

      </article>

      <article class="story-card featured">

        <div class="quote-mark">“</div>

        <p>

          Through the mentorship, prayer meetings and business sessions,
          I found clarity for my purpose and the confidence to launch
          my business.

        </p>

        <div class="story-author">

          <div class="avatar">

            AA

          </div>

          <div>

            <h4>Ada A.</h4>

            <span>Nigeria</span>

          </div>

        </div>

      </article>

      <article class="story-card">

        <div class="quote-mark">“</div>

        <p>

          I've found genuine friendships, spiritual accountability and
          a place where I truly belong. It feels like family.

        </p>

        <div class="story-author">

          <div class="avatar">

            LM

          </div>

          <div>

            <h4>Linda M.</h4>

            <span>Canada</span>

          </div>

        </div>

      </article>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>